ilesystem of the operation this store serves (spec\n    77\t\t// pose-update-dry-run-reports-the-whole-update D2): nil reads and writes\n    78\t\t// the disk, a preview reads its staged view. A store built from this one\n    79\t\t// carries it on.\n    80\t\tFS Files\n    81\t\t// planWithoutCloseoutGate builds a review plan without asking the\n    82\t\t// closeout review gate, for the gate's own question about the plan's\n    83\t\t// effective independence (spec pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit).\n    84\t\tplanWithoutCloseoutGate bool\n    85\t}\n    86\t\n    87\t// fsys is the store's filesystem.\n    88\tfunc (s Store) fsys() Files { return FilesOrNative(s.FS) }\n    89\t\n    90\t// specSnapshot holds one read of the specs directory. GetSpec lists every\n    91\t// spec to find one, and the obligation producers call it per spec, so a\n    92\t// projection read every spec file once per spec per producer.\n    93\ttype specSnapshot struct {\n    94\t\tonce  sync.Once\n    95\t\tspecs []Spec\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
