{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"pwd; git rev-parse HEAD; git status --short; printf 'POSE_REVIEW_CLI=%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$POSE_REVIEW_CLI\"; git diff --stat ddb770352f35f2f55c740e9a8479686de3a251e5..HEAD'","aggregated_output":"/var/tmp/pose-work-go/pose-review-run-3049222496/worktree\n7eda2dc4869af2b6f4ccf64914c65bfd3f06eb3a\nPOSE_REVIEW_CLI=/var/tmp/pose-work-go/pose-ready\n .pose/indexes/delivery-integrity.json              | 3283 ++++++++++++------\n .pose/indexes/generation.json                      |   18 +-\n .pose/indexes/spec-graph.json                      | 1196 +++----\n .pose/policy/delegation.json                       |   22 +-\n .pose/results/assess-sealed-binding.md             |    2 +\n .pose/results/delivery-validation.json             | 1318 +++----\n .pose/results/reap-binding.md                      |    3 +\n .../13be3e0d9eb721a49795feab/000001.json           |   11 +\n .../13be3e0d9eb721a49795feab/000001.result.json    |    6 +\n .../13be3e0d9eb721a49795feab/000002.json           |   12 +\n .../13be3e0d9eb721a49795feab/000002.result.json    |    6 +\n .../45a7f7f91f18049364f42b7c/000001.json           |   11 +\n .../45a7f7f91f18049364f42b7c/000001.result.json    |    6 +\n .../529e6fdc431afa130d108259/000001.json           |   11 +\n .../529e6fdc431afa130d108259/000001.result.json    |    6 +\n .../e77c0116a3eeab9b1da7488e/000001.json           |   11 +\n .../e77c0116a3eeab9b1da7488e/000001.result.json    |    6 +\n .../review-attestations/rva-10dd57a60cb87407.json  |  236 ++\n .../review-attestations/rva-95347b9099638546.json  |  206 ++\n .../review-attestations/rva-c50dbac6287a7a96.json  |  235 ++\n .pose/review-bundles/rvb-2a820a7a2fc91123.json     | 3660 ++++++++++++++++++++\n .pose/review-bundles/rvb-463c1d036776b14f.json     | 3553 +++++++++++++++++++\n .pose/review-bundles/rvb-aa10a0acf3fc6576.json     | 3622 +++++++++++++++++++\n .pose/review-bundles/rvb-f71272a8111