 run write can also leave no receipt.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"N2\",\n      \"severity\": \"high\",\n      \"disposition\": \"blocker\",\n      \"file\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_release.go\",\n      \"line\": 184,\n      \"summary\": \"A markerless reservation is released based on age alone, without proving its dispatch owner is dead. An earlier engine paused after reserving can still be live after ten minutes; discarded marker/run loss reports also make absence unproven, allowing a live attempt to be released and overlap a later dispatch.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"N3\",\n      \"severity\": \"medium\",\n      \"disposition\": \"blocker\",\n      \"file\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_release.go\",\n      \"line\": 174,\n      \"summary\": \"orphanReservations silently skips unreadable or invalid reservations and unreadable receipt paths. delegate ls then omits a blocked attempt without adding a loss diagnostic, while later admission can still refuse it.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"prior_findings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"R1-N1\",\n      \"status\": \"fixed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go:770-790 publishes the active marker before the normal reservation; pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_release_test.go:107-128\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"R1-N4\",\n      \"status\": \"fixed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_reap_linux.go:53-64,88-128; review_reap_linux_test.go:74-89\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"R2-N1\",\n      \"status\": \"fixed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_list.go:190-203; delegation_release.go:132-190; delegation_release_test.go:243-280\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"R2-N2\",\n      \"status\": \"fixed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go:1024-1053; review_reap_linux.go:58-64; review_reap_linux_test.go:77-89\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"R2-N3\",\n      \"status\": \"fixed\",\n      \"evidence\": 